      "title": "Stefan Thomas - Web Monetization: An Alternative to Ads  - View Source 2019",
      "description": "#viewsourceconf #coil #grantfortheweb #webmonetization #stefanthomas \nIndependent creators on the web today are increasingly forced into a handful of content platforms. Web Monetization is a proposed new web standard which provides an alternative to ads and site-by-site subscriptions. It has the potential to level the playing field between indie creators and giant tech companies.",
